    "startLine": 100,
    "endLine": 106,
    "quote": "\\begin{corollary}\\label{cor:ep_d}\nIf $M$ is $(\\epsilon, \\delta)$-DP on $X^m$, then the subsampled mechanism $M\\circ\\Sample_m$ is $C_p(f_{\\epsilon, \\delta})$-DP on $X^n$, where\n\\begin{equation}\\label{eq:ep_d_sump_for}\nC_p(f_{\\epsilon, \\delta})(\\alpha) = \\max\\left\\{f_{\\epsilon', \\delta'}(\\alpha), 1 - p\\delta - p \\, \\frac{\\e^{\\ep} - 1}{\\e^{\\ep} + 1} - \\alpha \\right\\}.\n\\end{equation}\nAbove, $\\epsilon'= \\log(1-p + p \\e^\\ep), \\delta' = p\\delta$, and $p = \\frac{m}{n}$.\n\\end{corollary}",
    "sha256": "11223a25e22c97b4c57dd08fd231d53da8c1664430c40cecb97a8c0e6eb561bb"
  },
